WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.088
Pay hides in odd places: seven
thousand two hundred a month,

2
00:00:04.088 --> 00:00:07.140
up to one-twenty K,
dollars on a Berlin job.

3
00:00:08.265 --> 00:00:10.901
Job Radar finds each figure,
quotes the sentence,

4
00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:13.245
and turns it into one yearly number.

5
00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:18.242
A bonus or a funding round is not
your salary, so it doesn't count.

6
00:00:18.242 --> 00:00:19.505
Foreign pay gets flagged.

7
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.050
One click keeps only the jobs
that state real pay or equity.
